---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home">

  <!-- ================================================
    HERO
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-navy text-cream text-center px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
    <p class="text-burgundy-light tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-6">
      YA Fantasy · The Land of Boondoggle Series
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl mb-6 leading-tight">
      Scott A. Lund
    </h1>
    <p class="font-serif italic text-xl md:text-2xl text-cream/80 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
      "Let's see what was happening in the Land of Boondoggle…"
    </p>
    <!-- Preorder CTA — hidden until links are ready; remove the `hidden` class to show -->
    <div class="hidden flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href="#"
        class="inline-block bg-burgundy hover:bg-burgundy-light text-cream font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-sm px-8 py-4 transition-colors"
      >
        Preorder Now
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================================================
    WELCOME / AUTHOR VOICE
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-cream px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10 md:gap-16">

      <img
        src="/images/author-portrait.jpg"
        alt="Scott A. Lund, author"
        class="w-48 md:w-64 rounded-sm shadow-lg flex-shrink-0 object-cover object-top aspect-[3/4]"
      />

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-8 text-center md:text-left">Welcome</h2>
        <div class="font-sans text-navy/80 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-5">
          <p>Pull up a chair by the fire and stay awhile.</p>
          <p>
            For forty years I've been telling stories — first to my daughters at bedtime, then to
            anyone who would listen. When my girls were young and wrestling with something in their
            lives — feeling left out, a first heartbreak, the hard questions about death — I'd fold
            it into that night's story, and together we'd travel to a place where those things could
            be faced, and understood, and survived. That place became the Land of Boondoggle.
          </p>
          <p>These stories grew up alongside my daughters. Now they're ready to leave home.</p>
          <p class="font-serif italic text-navy text-xl pt-2">
            "Let's see what was happening in the Land of Boondoggle…"
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================================================
    BOOKS
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-cream-dark px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy text-center mb-4">The Books</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-navy/60 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-14">
        The Land of Boondoggle Series
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-start">

        <!-- Book One -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-5">
          <img
            src="/images/book-one-cover.png"
            alt="The Land of Boondoggle — Book One cover"
            class="w-48 md:w-56 shadow-lg rounded-sm"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="text-burgundy tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-2">Book One</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mb-3">The Land of Boondoggle</h3>
            <p class="text-navy/60 text-sm mb-5">
              Synopsis coming soon. Releasing late Q4 2026.
            </p>
            <a
              href="/books/the-land-of-boondoggle"
              class="inline-block border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-6 py-3 transition-colors"
            >
              Learn More
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Book Two -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-5">
          <img
            src="/images/book-two-cover.png"
            alt="Heirs of The Gorilla King — Book Two cover"
            class="w-48 md:w-56 shadow-lg rounded-sm"
          />
          <div>
            <p class="text-burgundy tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-2">Book Two</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mb-3">Heirs of The Gorilla King</h3>
            <p class="text-navy/60 text-sm mb-5 max-w-sm mx-auto">
              In a kingdom ruled by three brother Kings, a fragile peace holds sway — and whispers
              of ancient magic linger in the air.
            </p>
            <a
              href="/books/heirs-of-the-gorilla-king"
              class="inline-block border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-6 py-3 transition-colors"
            >
              Learn More
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================================================
    ENDORSEMENTS — hidden until real blurbs arrive
    To show: remove the `hidden` class from the <section> tag
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="hidden bg-navy text-cream px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-center mb-14">What Readers Are Saying</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">

        {/* Blurb template — duplicate this block for each endorsement */}
        <blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <p class="font-serif italic text-cream/90 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            "Quote text here — vivid, specific praise for the book."
          </p>
          <footer>
            <p class="font-sans font-bold text-cream text-sm tracking-wide">— REVIEWER NAME</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-cream/60 text-xs">Author of Their Book</p>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <p class="font-serif italic text-cream/90 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            "Quote text here — vivid, specific praise for the book."
          </p>
          <footer>
            <p class="font-sans font-bold text-cream text-sm tracking-wide">— REVIEWER NAME</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-cream/60 text-xs">Author of Their Book</p>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <p class="font-serif italic text-cream/90 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            "Quote text here — vivid, specific praise for the book."
          </p>
          <footer>
            <p class="font-sans font-bold text-cream text-sm tracking-wide">— REVIEWER NAME</p>
            <p class="font-sans text-cream/60 text-xs">Author of Their Book</p>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================================================
    NEWSLETTER SIGNUP
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-cream px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-4">Stay in the Story</h2>
      <p class="text-navy/70 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Sign up for updates from the Land of Boondoggle — release news, exclusive excerpts,
        and the occasional bedtime story from Scott himself.
      </p>
      <form
        class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3"
        onsubmit="return false;"
        aria-label="Newsletter signup"
      >
        <input
          type="email"
          placeholder="your@email.com"
          required
          class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 border border-navy/30 bg-white text-navy placeholder-navy/40 focus:outline-none focus:border-burgundy font-sans text-sm"
        />
        <button
          type="submit"
          class="bg-burgundy hover:bg-burgundy-light text-cream font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs px-8 py-3 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Subscribe
        </button>
      </form>
      <p class="text-navy/40 text-xs mt-4">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ================================================
    ABOUT TEASER
  ================================================ -->
  <section class="bg-cream-dark px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">About the Author</h2>
      <p class="text-navy/70 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Scott A. Lund is a storyteller by nature — writing poems, stories, and songs for forty years.
        The Land of Boondoggle began as bedtime stories told to his daughters, growing over the years
        into a richly detailed world of magic, family, and the challenges we all face growing up.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-block border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-8 py-3 transition-colors"
      >
        Meet Scott
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
